.autoeda/runtime/versions.md:5586:- algorithm summary: `stmap98` adds `Map_Stmap93SetEmittedDriveTargetMaxMode()` to the existing emitted-drive hook. The default max mode remains `3`, preserving older commands. `stmap98` sets max mode `2` around watched networks, so mode 3 bypasses the emitted-drive hook entirely, and resets max mode to `3` after the run.
.autoeda/runtime/versions.md:5588:  - build, help, smoke, path-normalization, stale-state, implementation checks, full benchmark evaluation, and CEC passed. Logs and parsed artifacts are under `.autoeda/runtime/results/stmap98/`.
